WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.660 --> 00:00:04.400
You know in some ways, League of Legends is a simple game.

00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:06.900
When it comes to champions, you have to
pick what everyone else does,

00:00:06.900 --> 00:00:09.540
and just try to play the game better than they do.

00:00:09.540 --> 00:00:13.620
Of course there are counter-picks, of course there's the odd fringe lock-in,

00:00:13.620 --> 00:00:19.360
but at the end of the day if you want to go truly off-script, if you want to pick a truly off-meta champion,

00:00:19.360 --> 00:00:25.020
well lets just say it's risky. You can get rekt, dumpstered, destroyed.

00:00:25.400 --> 00:00:32.620
Or everything can work out in your favor, and that crazy pocket pick could deliver you and your team to glory.

00:00:32.620 --> 00:00:39.020
That's why this week on Best of we're focusing on the craziest off-meta champion picks that actually worked,

00:00:39.020 --> 00:00:40.540
and a few that didn't.

00:00:40.540 --> 00:00:43.620
But let's start this video off on a positive note shall we?

00:00:43.620 --> 00:02:54.880
(Casting)

00:02:55.300 --> 00:02:56.700
"Wow."

00:02:56.700 --> 00:05:50.560
(Casting)

00:05:50.620 --> 00:05:56.560
"That team composition was specifically drafted to counter LeBlanc in every way, shape, and form."

00:05:56.560 --> 00:06:04.960
"Tanks, spell shields, left, right, and center, lots of magic resist, and it just shows how hard it is to beat this guy's LeBlanc."

00:06:04.960 --> 00:10:55.000
(Casting)

00:10:55.460 --> 00:10:59.780
You know sometimes, that successful off-meta pick can make you a pioneer.

00:10:59.780 --> 00:11:03.440
All of a sudden your crazy pocket champion is the new normal.

00:11:03.440 --> 00:16:37.260
(Casting)

00:16:37.260 --> 00:16:43.740
You know, sometimes when you play an off-meta champ, you can go from looking like you have 200 IQ, to being in Bronze V.

00:16:43.740 --> 00:16:46.180
Sometimes those pocket picks just don't work out.

00:16:46.180 --> 00:17:12.620
(Casting)

00:17:19.280 --> 00:21:23.660
(Casting)

00:21:24.060 --> 00:21:29.420
Well guys, that's Best of for this week, now if we missed your favorite off-meta champion pick,

00:21:29.420 --> 00:21:34.200
I care, email me at Colin.McNeil@nobodygivesaf---

